      "content": "the thing is i've taken my usual migraine meds and they aren't really doing much. i'm also feeling a bit nauseous and lightheaded. is it possible my body is just reacting to the intensity of the migraine? like, maybe i should just take a double dose of my sumatriptan and sleep it off instead of dealing with the hospital trip?",
