      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overreacting now. i have such bad anxiety about hospitals and the lights in there make my head hurt way worse. if i just take an extra pill and stay in a dark room with a cold compress, can you at least tell me if that's a safe way to ride this out? i feel like i can manage it if i just stay quiet and dark. is it really that urgent if i've had migraines my whole life?",
